Subject: Model.cpp without the readers that need the libraries orca_core leaves out

With ORCA_CORE_SLICING_ONLY defined, Model.cpp does not read STEP, textured meshes, OBJ, glTF, FBX, SVG or DRC (OpenCASCADE, OpenCV,
assimp, Draco and the SVG to solid code are not built). The readers that remain are STL, 3MF and AMF (and Orca's own .oltp). What
read_from_file does with any other file name is what Orca's code already did for one it does not know. Anything not under the
ORCA_CORE_SLICING_ONLY guard is Orca's code unchanged.
Orca Slicer v2.5.2, commit f92a7c065c5718b8ef1baac1cd704df2911238f4.

